# Template for `deploy/env/web-build.env` -- the gitignored file baked into the
# `caddy` image's Vite build (deploy/Dockerfile.web). `./provision.sh secrets`
# creates it empty; an absent or empty file is fine and renders the operator's
# identifiers as "being issued" / omitted.
#
# PUBLIC: every value here is baked into the JavaScript bundle served to every
# visitor. It must NEVER hold a secret. The build refuses any key other than the
# two below, and any `$` (Vite would expand it silently).
#
# FORMAT: KEY=value. Double-quote the address, and note that an unquoted ` #`
# truncates the value. Allowed address characters: ASCII letters, digits,
# spaces and , . - / # ( ) & '  (at most 200). Anything else fails the build.
#
# The same two values go on Cloudflare Pages (docs/DOMAIN-AND-EMAIL-SETUP.md
# section 3), and the LLPIN also goes in backend.env. Rebuild `caddy` after a change.
#
# Every key carries a `#@` tag; the grammar is in backend.env.example's header.
#@ config vendor optional pattern=^[A-Z]{3}-[0-9]{4}$
VITE_OPERATOR_LLPIN=
#@ config setting optional
VITE_OPERATOR_REGISTERED_OFFICE=""
